---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Solutions | CtrlBuild Technologies"
  description="Explore practical software and digital solutions from CtrlBuild Technologies for organisations, teams and growing businesses."
>
  <main>
    <section class="cb-page-hero">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <p class="cb-eyebrow">/ SOLUTIONS</p>

        <h1>
          Systems designed around <span>how you work.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="cb-page-hero__intro">
          We turn operational challenges into practical digital systems,
          combining software engineering, automation and data to help
          organisations work more effectively.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cb-solutions-list">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <div class="cb-solution">
          <span class="cb-solution__number">01</span>

          <div class="cb-solution__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">BUSINESS OPERATIONS</p>
            <h2>Business management systems</h2>
            <p>
              Bring important business processes into one structured system,
              reducing fragmented workflows and giving teams better visibility
              over daily operations.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Business administration</li>
              <li>Staff management</li>
              <li>Inventory and records</li>
              <li>Workflow management</li>
              <li>Operational dashboards</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-solution">
          <span class="cb-solution__number">02</span>

          <div class="cb-solution__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">EDUCATION & INSTITUTIONS</p>
            <h2>Education management platforms</h2>
            <p>
              Digital platforms for schools and educational organisations
              that connect academic, administrative and communication
              workflows.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Student management</li>
              <li>Academic administration</li>
              <li>Parent and student portals</li>
              <li>Assessment and reporting</li>
              <li>School operations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-solution">
          <span class="cb-solution__number">03</span>

          <div class="cb-solution__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">CUSTOM PLATFORMS</p>
            <h2>Multi-user digital platforms</h2>
            <p>
              Build platforms where different users, teams or organisations
              interact with the same underlying system while seeing the tools
              and information relevant to them.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Multi-tenant applications</li>
              <li>Customer portals</li>
              <li>Role-based dashboards</li>
              <li>Subscription platforms</li>
              <li>Self-service systems</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-solution">
          <span class="cb-solution__number">04</span>

          <div class="cb-solution__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">DIGITAL COMMERCE</p>
            <h2>Commerce & payment systems</h2>
            <p>
              Digital systems that support selling, payments, order
              processing and the operational workflows behind commercial
              activity.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Online commerce platforms</li>
              <li>Point-of-sale systems</li>
              <li>Payment integrations</li>
              <li>Order management</li>
              <li>Transaction reporting</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-solution">
          <span class="cb-solution__number">05</span>

          <div class="cb-solution__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">DATA & AUTOMATION</p>
            <h2>Data-driven workflows</h2>
            <p>
              Make operational information easier to collect, process,
              understand and act on through connected data systems and
              automation.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Automated workflows</li>
              <li>Business reporting</li>
              <li>Data dashboards</li>
              <li>Information processing</li>
              <li>System integrations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-solution">
          <span class="cb-solution__number">06</span>

          <div class="cb-solution__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">DIGITAL PRODUCTS</p>
            <h2>New products from idea to launch</h2>
            <p>
              Turn an early product concept into a usable digital product with
              a clear technical foundation and a path for future growth.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Product discovery</li>
              <li>Technical architecture</li>
              <li>MVP development</li>
              <li>Web and mobile products</li>
              <li>Product iteration</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cb-solutions-cta">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <div class="cb-solutions-cta__panel">
          <p class="cb-eyebrow">/ HAVE A PROBLEM?</p>

          <h2>
            We can help turn the problem into a
            <span>system.</span>
          </h2>

          <p>
            Start with the problem, not the technology. Tell us what is
            happening in your organisation and we can help define the right
            digital approach.
          </p>

          <a href="/contact/">
            Discuss your project
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .cb-page-hero {
    padding: 9rem 0 7rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cb-page-hero h1 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .cb-page-hero h1 span {
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
  }

  .cb-page-hero__intro {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .cb-solutions-list {
    padding: 2rem 0 0;
  }

  .cb-solution {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cb-solution__number {
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cb-solution__content {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .cb-solution__content h2 {
    max-width: 16ch;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .cb-solution__content > p:not(.cb-eyebrow) {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cb-solution__content ul {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem 2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .cb-solution__content li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .cb-solution__content li::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.55em;
    left: 0;
    width: 0.3rem;
    height: 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-brand-coral);
    content: '';
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta {
    padding: 8rem 0;
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta__panel {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta__panel h2 {
    max-width: 14ch;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 0.97;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta__panel h2 span {
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta__panel > p:not(.cb-eyebrow) {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta__panel a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta__panel a span {
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .cb-solutions-cta__panel a:hover span {
    transform: translate(3px, -3px);
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .cb-page-hero {
      padding: 11rem 0 8rem;
    }

    .cb-solution {
      grid-template-columns: 5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }

    .cb-solutions-cta__panel {
      padding: 6rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cb-page-hero {
      padding: 7rem 0 5rem;
    }

    .cb-solution__content ul {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .cb-solutions-cta {
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cb-solutions-cta__panel a span {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
EOFmkdir -p src/pages/solutions

